  "prompt": "Create a new team meeting: 'Engineering sync' on 2026-11-09 at 15:00 UTC, 60 minutes, attendees: alice@example.com, bob@example.com, carol@example.com. Once it's scheduled, list everything on the calendar for 2026-11-09 so I can confirm the new meeting is there.",
